        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CAREND19ENTR, Single Cylinder Eden Prairie Egg Knob with Carre Tall Plate Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Entry Set Eden Prairie Knob with Carre Tall Plate features an egg shaped knob and classic elegance. This pairing of the Carre Tall Plate and the Eden Prairie Knob is delightfully old world feeling and boasts grace and style. Choose from one of several rich finish options. The Grandeur Carre Tall Plate Entrance Set with Eden Prairie Knob features a single cylinder lock for security. It will fit many standard pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/eden-prairie-knob-with-carre-tall-plate-grandeur-caredn19\"><b>Eden Prairie Knob with Carre Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Carre Tall Plate Entrance Set with Eden Prairie Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Eden Prairie Knob Single Cylinder Entryset with Carre Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CAREDN19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262398\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CAREDN19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
